    <string name="about_feature_details">• SIM country-code editor adapted for Android 16\n• Uses Shizuku system capabilities; Root is not required\n• Uses a dual-APK helper to work with Android 16 hidden API restrictions\n• Shows the current configuration and override state for SIM 1 / SIM 2\n• Supports separate country-code settings on dual-SIM devices\n• Saves configuration and restores the current override in one tap</string>
